# No libraries here on purpose: `## Dependencies: Raidify` guarantees the core
# addon has already loaded LibStub and Ace3, and loading a second copy would
# fight core over the shared LibStub registry.

# The boundary first — it self-disables the rest if core is missing or the API
# version does not match, so nothing below ever runs against a core it cannot use.
